## Research Objective

The proposed research aims to investigate how conformal calibration and risk-aware neural contextual bandits can support dynamic pricing decisions that improve business performance while respecting specified safety constraints, particularly when demand conditions change over time.

The contribution must be established through a literature review, clearly defined risk guarantees, appropriate baselines, and reproducible experiments.

## Important Note

This document is a conceptual learning guide, not a claim that a particular algorithm or dataset has already been validated. All formal guarantees depend on the assumptions of the selected methods and the experimental setting.
